msgid "Pay with Cryptocurrency"
msgstr "Payer avec Cryptomonnaie"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:204
msgid ""
"Payment method name shown at checkout (e.g. “Pay with Cryptocurrency”)."
msgstr ""
"Nom du mode de paiement affiché à la caisse (p. ex., Payez avec "
"Cryptomonnaie)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:208
msgid "Checkout description"
msgstr "Description de la vérification"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:214
msgid "Checkout label style"
msgstr "Style d'étiquette de vérification"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:227
msgid "Choose how the payment method is identified on the checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez comment le mode de paiement est identifié sur la page de "
"paiement."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:231
msgid "Checkout icon"
msgstr "Icône de vérification"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:245
msgid "Upload / replace icon"
msgstr "Télécharger / remplacer l'icône"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:246
msgid "Use default icon"
msgstr "Utiliser l'icône par défaut"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:248
msgid ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP, or SVG. Default plugin icon is used when none is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP ou SVG. L'icône de plugin par défaut est utilisée "
"lorsque aucune n'est sélectionnée."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:253
msgid "Icon size (px)"
msgstr "Taille de l'icône (px)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:256
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Largeur"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:260
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Hauteur"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:263
msgid "Recommended: 24–40px. Allowed range: 16–128."
msgstr "Recommandé : 24–40px. Portée autorisée : 16-128."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:267
msgid "WooCommerce gateway"
msgstr "Porte WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:270
msgid "Enable gateway in Payments settings"
msgstr "Activer la passerelle dans les paramètres de paiement"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:277
msgid ""
"Leave min / max empty for no limit. Coins outside the limits are hidden at "
"checkout — useful where network fees make small orders impractical."
msgstr ""
"Laisser min / max vide sans limite. Les pièces en dehors des limites sont "
"cachées à la caisse — utile là où les frais de réseau rendent les petites "
"commandes impossibles."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:278
msgid ""
"Confirmations shown in grey are what this coin waits for now. Type a number "
"to require your own instead — higher is safer and slower."
msgstr ""
"Les confirmations en gris sont ce que cette pièce attend maintenant. Tapez "
"un nombre pour demander le vôtre à la place — plus est plus sûr et plus "
"lent."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:279
msgid ""
"A price adjustment is a percentage off (or on) an order paid in that coin — "
"enter -2 to take 2% off, 1.5 to add 1.5%. It appears on the order as its own"
" line, so the total the customer sees is the total they pay."
msgstr ""
"Un ajustement de prix est un pourcentage (ou sur) d'une commande payée dans "
"cette pièce — inscrivez -2 pour retirer 2% de réduction, 1,5 pour ajouter "
"1,5%. Il apparaît sur la commande comme sa propre ligne, donc le total que "
"le client voit est le total qu'il paie."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:280
msgid ""
"Auto-verify uses public blockchain APIs. Coins marked Manual (such as "
"Monero) have no free way to detect payments — confirm those with “Mark "
"payment received” on the order."
msgstr ""
"Auto-vérify utilise des API blockchain publiques. Les pièces marquées Manuel"
" (comme Monero) n'ont aucun moyen libre de détecter les paiements — "
"confirmer ceux avec le paiement de marque reçu sur la commande."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:284
msgid "USDT (multi-network)"
msgstr "USDT (réseaux multiples)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:285
